    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OUT OF BOUNDS</strong> is a first-person survival sandbox set in the Backrooms. Will you survive long enough to find an exit, or will you perish to the dangers lurking in this never-ending nightmare?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089390/extras/e5b06a28c102f3bc6cafcd1dfcbd5c8e.avif?t=1751500077\" width=600 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089390/extras/f7acd0618d1d91c2fe9b57fecb48be86.avif?t=1751500077\" width=600 height=338 /></span>Different levels to explore, with different and unique resources.<br>Every object can be moved around with physics or can be interacted with; If you see it, you can do something with it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089390/extras/d14342dae53cf0bc94d18abe33c09ce8.avif?t=1751500077\" width=600 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089390/extras/b96bca49c298cdddbddc214605dab338.avif?t=1751500077\" width=600 height=338 /></span>Various crafting recipes for you to discover and unlock through a vast tech tree.<br>Bandages, makeshift weapons, electrical and mechanical components and parts. Every recipe has its purpose. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089390/extras/26e9fb7fa3b22f319730b437f6ea472e.avif?t=1751500077\" width=600 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089390/extras/0ab20a660e29af1ffb46d46e4f143a69.avif?t=1751500077\" width=600 height=338 /></span>Almost every object can be moved around freely and can be anchored and fixed in place. Make a base to store your resources and keep all your working stations, while you stay safe from any hostile entities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089390/extras/46fc0dddcfefbf5fc134c342ee61584d.avif?t=1751500077\" width=600 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089390/extras/942b1e66144a1ac9704a14fbc6a22529.avif?t=1751500077\" width=600 height=338 /></span>Your ultimate goal is to escape and get back home. With no apparent way of communicating with the outside world, you're stuck alone with your thoughts.<br>Will they get to you, before you can get to the exit?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OUT OF BOUNDS</strong> is a first-person survival sandbox set in the Backrooms. Will you survive long enough to find an exit, or will you perish to the dangers lurking in this never-ending nightmare?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089390/extras/e5b06a28c102f3bc6cafcd1dfcbd5c8e.avif?t=1751500077\" width=600 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089390/extras/f7acd0618d1d91c2fe9b57fecb48be86.avif?t=1751500077\" width=600 height=338 /></span>Different levels to explore, with different and unique resources.<br>Every object can be moved around with physics or can be interacted with; If you see it, you can do something with it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089390/extras/d14342dae53cf0bc94d18abe33c09ce8.avif?t=1751500077\" width=600 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089390/extras/b96bca49c298cdddbddc214605dab338.avif?t=1751500077\" width=600 height=338 /></span>Various crafting recipes for you to discover and unlock through a vast tech tree.<br>Bandages, makeshift weapons, electrical and mechanical components and parts. Every recipe has its purpose. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089390/extras/26e9fb7fa3b22f319730b437f6ea472e.avif?t=1751500077\" width=600 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089390/extras/0ab20a660e29af1ffb46d46e4f143a69.avif?t=1751500077\" width=600 height=338 /></span>Almost every object can be moved around freely and can be anchored and fixed in place. Make a base to store your resources and keep all your working stations, while you stay safe from any hostile entities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089390/extras/46fc0dddcfefbf5fc134c342ee61584d.avif?t=1751500077\" width=600 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089390/extras/942b1e66144a1ac9704a14fbc6a22529.avif?t=1751500077\" width=600 height=338 /></span>Your ultimate goal is to escape and get back home. With no apparent way of communicating with the outside world, you're stuck alone with your thoughts.<br>Will they get to you, before you can get to the exit?</p>",
    "short_description": "OUT OF BOUNDS is a survival sandbox game set in the Backrooms universe. Explore, gather resources, craft weapons and components, fight enemies and build a base to survive while you try to escape the endless hellscape you're now stuck inside of.",
